From f4623972354b45c1370768592bc0210b05023fe4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:29:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD review completion confirmation so clean patch chats
 can close or reopen

Clean review results append a yes/no completion prompt to the patch-agent chat. A yes answer records the feature as done and hides it from the terminal left pane, while no or later follow-up work keeps the chat available for more patching.
